00:26:40.000 --> 00:27:21.000
with psychological and neurological disorders. But we know less about the high-end hyperphantasia than the Afantasia at this stage. So we don't know a lot, but I've certainly met individuals who say they can they can sort of replay a whole film and they swear to me their conscious experience is like watching it on an iPad. It's that clear. Now, I absolutely can't do that. So it's, it is hard for me to believe that, but they, I've only met one or two people that say that and we haven't had a chance to study them in detail yet. But there are seemingly individuals who can do that. So, So yeah, that's a big difference from no imagery at all.

